<title>CANADA: Slocan Forest Q1 shr profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Slocan Forest Q1 shr profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, British Columbia 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr    profit  C$0.15	  loss   C$0.23</p>
<p> Net    profit   4,600	  loss    7,000</p>
<p> Sales	    204,700		  185,800</p>
<p>(All data above 000s of Canadian dollars except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The 1996 net loss included write-downs of pulp and chip inventories totalling $8.9 million due to a decline in demand and prices for those products.</p>
<p>New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
